1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:09,141
Last time, we felt the beat.

3
00:00:11,741 --> 00:00:17,056
Today we are going to look
at the keys of a piano.

4
00:00:19,556 --> 00:00:23,014
A piano has white keys.

5
00:00:25,314 --> 00:00:28,076
And black keys.

6
00:00:31,576 --> 00:00:33,640
Look at the black keys.

7
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,869
They come in groups.

8
00:00:39,769 --> 00:00:43,274
This group has two black keys.

9
00:00:44,374 --> 00:00:45,574
One.

10
00:00:46,424 --> 00:00:47,624
Two.

11
00:00:50,367 --> 00:00:53,500
This group has three black keys.

12
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,800
One.

13
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:57,850
Two.

14
00:00:58,793 --> 00:00:59,993
Three.

15
00:01:02,983 --> 00:01:08,205
Two… then three… two… then three.

16
00:01:11,705 --> 00:01:16,463
The pattern repeats all
the way along the piano.

17
00:01:19,763 --> 00:01:24,150
It is like a map, that
helps us find our way.

18
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:31,983
Your turn! Is this a
group of two, or three?

19
00:01:37,083 --> 00:01:38,283
Two!

20
00:01:45,366 --> 00:01:46,566
Three!

21
00:01:53,509 --> 00:01:54,709
Two!

22
00:01:55,245 --> 00:01:56,566
You've got it!

23
00:01:58,266 --> 00:01:59,727
Now it's your turn!

24
00:01:59,827 --> 00:02:03,796
Play Black Key Patterns,
and find the groups!

25
00:02:03,896 --> 00:02:06,286
See you for the next Nugget!

